
1.  SOFTWARE PRODUCT DESCRIPTION

Product Name:           MOLE-COP8-IBM
Software Part Number:   925410527-001
Description:            COP800 Assembler Release E
System:                 MS-DOS 2.0 or later (5.25" PC-DOS format)

This release  package contains software to support development of
programs  for National Semiconductor's COP800 series of microcon-
trollers, and is primarily meant for use  with  the  COP800  MOLE
development system.  The software executes on an IBM PC/XT/AT or
compatible  running  MS-DOS  or  PC-DOS.    The   communication
software  requires  certain  hardware compatibility with the  IBM
PC/XT/AT.

This package consists of the following programs:
________________________________________________________________
          Name              Rev       Date         Description
_________________________________________________________________
 ASM800 		    E          21 JUN 90  Cross-assembler
                                                  for COP800
_________________________________________________________________
 HEXLM                      D         27 JUL 87   Hex file to
                                                  MOLE LM
                                                  translation
                                                  utility
_________________________________________________________________
 LMHEX			    D         27 JUL 87   MOLE LM to
                                                  Hex file
                                                  translation
                                                  utility
_________________________________________________________________
 COMM                       A         22 JUL 83   IBM PC Com-
                                                  munication
                                                  program used
                                                  with MOLE
_________________________________________________________________
 COMM2  		    A         22 JUL 83   IBM PC Com-
                                                  munication
                                                  program used
                                                  with MOLE
_________________________________________________________________
 PC-TALK                                          General pur-
                                                  pose IBM PC
                                                  communication
                                                  program
_________________________________________________________________




2.  OPERATING ENVIRONMENT

This  package has been developed and tested on a IBM AT  running
PC-DOS  3.2.   This   package  runs  under  MS-DOS  or  PC-DOS
operating system, Rev. 2.0 or later, on an IBM PC/XT/AT or  com-
patible.  The  communication  software  requires certain hardware
compatibility with the IBM PC/XT/AT.   The  system  requirements
are:
1. At  least  128  free Kbytes of memory. 
2. A 5.25" inch floppy drive capable of reading double sided 
double density PC-DOS  2.x format diskettes.
3. An asynchronous, RS232-compatible serial port for communication.


